      "instance_name": "chimpanzee_protest_scene",
      "label": "chimpanzee protest scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting four chimpanzees sitting on the ground in a natural outdoor setting, arranged in a group with one central chimpanzee, another to its left with hand on chin, one to its right, and one partially visible behind. The scene is overlaid with text that satirically frames the chimpanzees as representing French protesters, mocking their hypocrisy regarding taxes and 'free shit'. The spatial arrangement suggests a group discussion or contemplation, with the central chimpanzee as the focal point.",
