      "label": "French protesters are mapped onto chimpanzees",
      "description": "The text 'why are the french protesting' and subsequent lines are mapped onto the visual entity of the chimpanzees, implying that the chimpanzees represent French citizens protesting. This is a direct analogical mapping where the visual material (chimpanzees) is used to stand in for the textual subject (French protesters).",
